{"id":276842043113536,"type":"album","name":"Dirt","artist":"Alice in Chains","year":1992,"weight":74,"info":{"cover":"https://dn710800.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-47f3efa5-137c-40e8-ab1b-42d57f5cfbbf/mbid-47f3efa5-137c-40e8-ab1b-42d57f5cfbbf-9835602113.jpg","kind":"Album","tracks":13,"country":"XW","aoty":86,"aoty_user":87,"sputnik":4.44,"yt":"19CXYQhqVu0","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/alice-in-chains/dirt","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/4843-alice-in-chains-dirt.php","sputnikmusic":"https://www.sputnikmusic.com/album/99/Alice-in-Chains-Dirt/"},"desc":"Dirt is the second studio album by the American rock band Alice in Chains and was released on September 29, 1992 through Columbia Records. Peaking at number six on the Billboard 200, the album was well received by music critics and has since been certified four-times platinum by the RIAA. It is nowadays considered as one of the best grunge/heavy metal albums and is usually on many \"Must have\" lists. The album spawned five singles: \"Would?\", \"Them Bones\", \"Angry Chair\", \"Rooster\", and \"Down in a Hole\". The songs on the album focused on depression, drug use, war, death, and other ."},"artist_ref":{"id":34857375835151,"name":"Alice in Chains","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Alice_in_Chains_Live_Leeds_2018.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":185670346256268,"type":"genre","name":"rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":3782,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":255263121494129,"type":"genre","name":"Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":3474,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":210192360016800,"type":"genre","name":"Alternative Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":2664,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":32992220995517,"type":"genre","name":"Grunge","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1361,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":174164112458259,"type":"genre","name":"Heavy Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weigh